  "content": {
    "title": "省高校毕业生就业指导中心党总支开展2019年春节阳光助残志愿服务活动",
    "source": "",
    "publishDate": "2019-02-02",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                    <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">2019年2月2日，在春节即将到来之际，省高校毕业生就业指导中心党总支苗立海、张中伟、李成志三名同志亲赴九台区荒山村，代表就业中心和教育宾馆全体党员对残疾老党员董艳庆同志进行了慰问、开展帮扶，持续推进阳光助残志愿服务活动。<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">苗立海等三名同志到老党员家，与董艳庆同志亲切交谈，了解他的生活情况、身体情况及实际困难，帮助打扫卫生、送去年货，同时送去中心党总支全体党员的新春祝福。董艳庆同志特别感动，表示感受到了党的温暖和组织的关怀，一定会身残志坚，战胜困难，在组织的帮扶下一定能创造美好生活。<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 3.75pt 0pt; text-indent: 32pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);><img src=\"assets/ec5e9d95144953277de18fc36e0c62f495f9239a7ccbe7f310b52f797267c750.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">2019年2月3日，残疾党员董艳庆到中心送来锦旗，表达了几年来中心党总支对他本人及家庭的关心与帮助的感激之情，迸发出“大爱无疆献真情，关怀备至暖人心”激动情感。<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">在中心党员活动室里，中心班子、教育宾馆班子成员及部分党员同志与董艳庆老人一起聊着他的境况。老人述说着现在党的政策及村里的巨大变化。他感叹有党和国家的好政策，有中心党组织对他的关心与照顾，自己特别开心，专程从九台赶到长春来，告诉大家他一切都好，请大家放心。全体党员也纷纷表示，以后老人若有困难还会伸出援助之手，中心党组织一定会不遗余力帮助他。与老人半个多小时的交流很快就过去了，大家一直都沉浸在温暖和节日喜庆的氛围之中。<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">长春教育宾馆支部还专程派人把董艳庆老人送回家，临别之时，老人也依依不舍，嘱咐年青党员同志，现在政策好，大家一定要好好工作，为单位、为长春、为建设小康社会努力奉献。<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 3.75pt 0pt; text-indent: 32pt;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\"><img src=\"assets/15dd9475c8ac1eaf2a925231e362377a52663d2970c19dd29fd15a658fad03e3.png\" style=\"text-align: left; max-width: 100%;\"></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 3.75pt 0pt; text-indent: 32pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);><img src=\"assets/832f7b4f2ac0bd2c5e13c6e95adce6a301b2336e298edbd649aa6fb5b2cbcf45.png\" style=\"text-align: left; max-width: 100%;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 3.75pt 0pt; text-indent: 32pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\"><img src=\"assets/0ba233f86ed013ac3cbb8ff8840b334204dfc41c8a1e84ef023346f13e0acec1.png\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml><w:LatentStyles DefLockedState=\"false\"  DefUnhideWhenUsed=\"true\"  DefSemiHidden=\"true\"  DefQFormat=\"false\"  DefPriority=\"99\"  LatentStyleCount=\"260\" >\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"Normal\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 1\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked